- candidate: PackageRef
  kind: class
  definition: An @beep/* workspace package identity represented in the materialized package topology.
  admission_kind: decision
  cq_justification:
  - CQ-004
  decision_relevance: Defines the package identities returned by CQ-004's touched-package dependency closure.
  evidence:
  - explorations/beep-ci-operational-ontology/ontology/docs/pre-glossary.csv:12 — 'PackageRef,class,CQ-004,"@beep/*
    workspace package identity"'
  - explorations/beep-ci-operational-ontology/ontology/extraction/s4/inputs/topo-sort.txt:5 — '@beep/hubspot
    4'
  already_in_glossary: true
  status: candidate
  source_lanes:
  - s4-package-topology
- candidate: dependsOn
  kind: property
  definition: Relates a PackageRef to a directly declared @beep/* dependency or devDependency PackageRef.
  domain: PackageRef
  range: PackageRef
  admission_kind: semantic-support
  supports:
  - dependsOnTransitive
  decision_relevance: Supplies the direct base edges from which CQ-004's dependency closure is computed.
  evidence:
  - 'explorations/beep-ci-operational-ontology/ontology/docs/pre-glossary.csv:55 — ''dependsOn,property,CQ-004,"direct
    workspace dependency edge; semantic-support (two-kind law): supports=dependsOnTransitive — the fixpoint''s
    base relation (round-3 I-03/H-09 licensing fix)"'''
  - 'packages/drivers/hubspot/package.json:62 — ''"@beep/identity": "workspace:^",'''
  - 'packages/drivers/hubspot/package.json:68 — ''"@beep/test-utils": "workspace:^",'''
  already_in_glossary: true
  status: candidate
  source_lanes:
  - s4-package-topology
- candidate: dependsOnTransitive
  kind: property
  definition: Relates a PackageRef to every PackageRef reachable through the Datalog fixpoint over dependsOn.
  domain: PackageRef
  range: PackageRef
  admission_kind: decision
  cq_justification:
  - CQ-004
  decision_relevance: Provides the dependency-closure relation queried by CQ-004.
  evidence:
  - explorations/beep-ci-operational-ontology/ontology/docs/pre-glossary.csv:54 — 'dependsOnTransitive,property,CQ-004,"Datalog
    fixpoint over dependsOn (rule-compiled)"'
  - explorations/beep-ci-operational-ontology/ontology/docs/competency-questions.yaml:116 — '?pkg ciops:dependsOnTransitive
    ?touched .'
  already_in_glossary: true
  status: candidate
  source_lanes:
  - s4-package-topology
